            "id": "nudge",
            "position": {
              "x": 900,
              "y": 0
            },
            "type": "send_message"
          },
          {
            "config": {
              "text": "Twenty hours, not twenty-four. Instagram closes the messaging window 24 hours after the contact's last message, and a reminder scheduled at the edge of it arrives to a closed door.\n\nThe deadline lives in the copy rather than in the delay. A fixed date baked into a template is already in the past by the time somebody downloads it, so the flow counts hours from the reply instead.\n\nBefore you publish: swap every example.com link for your own, rename the tags to match yours, and rewrite the copy in your voice."
            },
            "id": "twenty_hours",
            "position": {
              "x": 1200,
              "y": 0
            },
            "type": "note"
          }
        ],
